+        ONE start state every rollout reads (the adapter field at the last
+        observed frame, + the motion injection when that flag is on), so
+        the head and the predictors can never disagree about what 'now'
+        is; ``tac`` the decision vector (`tac_decision`).
+        Returns ``traj_prior`` / ``traj_residual`` / ``traj_pred`` [B, K, 2]."""
+        if self.traj_head is None:
+            raise RuntimeError("traj_readout on a model built with w_traj=0")
